  "ai_article_sha256": "5b541f538895dd84274e353740449299729976c12a25e0f70b0a695cf0befe08",
  "mixed_article_sha256": "5248fdd9ae7bb42e18002cbd1b141d9aba3b0ab7571460c1f03bf395dbd34f06",
  "human_source_sentence_count": 59,
  "ai_source_sentence_count": 51,
  "alignment_unit_count": 48,
  "selected_alignment_unit_count": 18,
  "mixed_sentence_count": 60,
  "selected_ai_sentence_count": 20,
  "actual_ai_sentence_ratio": 0.333333,
  "selected_alignment_score_min": 0.259256,
  "selected_alignment_score_median": 0.470029,
  "selected_alignment_score_max": 0.699969,
  "segments": [
    {
      "sentence_index": 1,
      "paragraph_index": 1,
      "origin": "human",
      "text": "Once when I was very young I met one of those men who have made the Empire what it is—a man in an astracan coat, with an astracan moustache—a tight, black, curly moustache.",
      "output_sha256": "f8d0e2ace51d23dd898a9a4b5fbc68661749e27c02bfe4875ec4558d868b6856",
      "alignment_unit_index": 1,
      "alignment_score": null,
      "source_human_sentence_index": 1,
      "source_human_sha256": "f8d0e2ace51d23dd898a9a4b5fbc68661749e27c02bfe4875ec4558d868b6856",
      "ai_unit_sentence_indices": []
    },
    {
      "sentence_index": 2,
      "paragraph_index": 1,
      "origin": "human",
      "text": "Whether he put on the moustache with the coat or whether his Napoleonic will enabled him not only to grow a moustache in the usual place, but also to grow little moustaches all over his clothes, I do not know.",
      "output_sha256": "5a51f5a899d31b63324d91df1774a39887f584ab51a517a2ed6241b60738aa97",
      "alignment_unit_index": 2,
      "alignment_score": null,
      "source_human_sentence_index": 2,
      "source_human_sha256": "5a51f5a899d31b63324d91df1774a39887f584ab51a517a2ed6241b60738aa97",
      "ai_unit_sentence_indices": []
    },
    {
      "sentence_index": 3,
      "paragraph_index": 1,
      "origin": "ai",
      "text": "I distinctly remember him telling me, “A man can’t get on nowadays by hanging about with his hands in his pockets.”",
      "output_sha256": "4319f97730a6918d562b0040f52d59dde139fe811f0bc5cc423fd31c916be301",
      "alignment_unit_index": 3,
      "alignment_score": 0.699969,
      "human_sentence_indices": [
        3
      ],
      "human_sha256": [
        "c285a6ee6b162b4e95314f0d30dd63a4ce80b003267527060d3b2623c401b78b"
      ],
      "source_ai_sentence_index": 3,
      "source_ai_sha256": "4319f97730a6918d562b0040f52d59dde139fe811f0bc5cc423fd31c916be301",
      "ai_unit_sentence_indices": [
        3
      ]
    },
    {
      "sentence_index": 4,
      "paragraph_index": 1,
      "origin": "ai",
      "text": "To this, I flippantly retorted that perhaps success came from having one’s hands in others’ pockets.",
      "output_sha256": "7eff616ab3d1086af3f8322ea22469d775785dd47e56ade31e8282152457a7f8",
      "alignment_unit_index": 4,
      "alignment_score": 0.402408,
      "human_sentence_indices": [
        4
      ],
      "human_sha256": [
        "2a1317050f22bb9b9cda5e3942046b701c97d0fab30cd4956c686168bbc4009f"
      ],
      "source_ai_sentence_index": 4,
      "source_ai_sha256": "7eff616ab3d1086af3f8322ea22469d775785dd47e56ade31e8282152457a7f8",
      "ai_unit_sentence_indices": [
        4,
        5
      ]
    },
    {
      "sentence_index": 5,
      "paragraph_index": 1,
      "origin": "ai",
      "text": "This prompted him to delve into a discussion on Moral Evolution, suggesting that my quip held some grain of truth.",
      "output_sha256": "73217895e17485515e06235b9fedf7cc2ec775c90885422010efd78f71087948",
      "alignment_unit_index": 4,
      "alignment_score": 0.402408,
      "human_sentence_indices": [
        4
      ],
      "human_sha256": [
        "2a1317050f22bb9b9cda5e3942046b701c97d0fab30cd4956c686168bbc4009f"
      ],
      "source_ai_sentence_index": 5,
      "source_ai_sha256": "73217895e17485515e06235b9fedf7cc2ec775c90885422010efd78f71087948",
      "ai_unit_sentence_indices": [
        4,
        5
      ]
    },
    {
      "sentence_index": 6,
      "paragraph_index": 1,
      "origin": "human",
      "text": "But the incident now comes back to me, and connects itself with another incident—if you can call it an incident—which happened to me only the other day.",
      "output_sha256": "3ad53d2646688ed07f3fd77d4df40990baddc2827ae7823ceabea3b18b5068b4",
      "alignment_unit_index": 5,
      "alignment_score": null,
      "source_human_sentence_index": 5,
      "source_human_sha256": "3ad53d2646688ed07f3fd77d4df40990baddc2827ae7823ceabea3b18b5068b4",
      "ai_unit_sentence_indices": []
    },
    {
      "sentence_index": 7,
      "paragraph_index": 2,
      "origin": "human",
      "text": "I have only once in my life picked a pocket, and then (perhaps through some absent-mindedness) I picked my own.",
      "output_sha256": "e3043afdbbf3451d795291ad4afdf27e93af49fbd6ddf88223d14eb6a393d845",
      "alignment_unit_index": 6,
      "alignment_score": null,
      "source_human_sentence_index": 6,
      "source_human_sha256": "e3043afdbbf3451d795291ad4afdf27e93af49fbd6ddf88223d14eb6a393d845",
      "ai_unit_sentence_indices": []
    },
    {
      "sentence_index": 8,
      "paragraph_index": 2,
      "origin": "human",
      "text": "My act can really with some reason be so described.",
      "output_sha256": "dcfb7db8574546a6c131942c047e6b22b92d5e2a2127627df6bc2e1885070e01",
      "alignment_unit_index": 6,
      "alignment_score": null,
      "source_human_sentence_index": 7,
      "source_human_sha256": "dcfb7db8574546a6c131942c047e6b22b92d5e2a2127627df6bc2e1885070e01",
      "ai_unit_sentence_indices": []
    },
    {
      "sentence_index": 9,
      "paragraph_index": 2,
      "origin": "human",
      "text": "For in taking things out of my own pocket I had at least one of the more tense and quivering emotions of the thief; I had a complete ignorance and a profound curiosity as to what I should find there.",
      "output_sha256": "29c2bb90d28a1281733845bd2a799d968cd41d94d29372c10493a8cdb14f8713",
      "alignment_unit_index": 7,
      "alignment_score": null,
      "source_human_sentence_index": 8,
      "source_human_sha256": "29c2bb90d28a1281733845bd2a799d968cd41d94d29372c10493a8cdb14f8713",
      "ai_unit_sentence_indices": []
    },
    {
      "sentence_index": 10,
      "paragraph_index": 2,
      "origin": "human",
      "text": "Perhaps it would be the exaggeration of eulogy to call me a tidy person.",
      "output_sha256": "f6502bd6f6d76cc73d59c563103d544e63cf74ec27cd52cdcee01ae787ecb81d",
      "alignment_unit_index": 8,
      "alignment_score": null,
      "source_human_sentence_index": 9,
      "source_human_sha256": "f6502bd6f6d76cc73d59c563103d544e63cf74ec27cd52cdcee01ae787ecb81d",
      "ai_unit_sentence_indices": []
    },
    {
      "sentence_index": 11,
      "paragraph_index": 2,
      "origin": "human",
      "text": "But I can always pretty satisfactorily account for all my possessions.",
      "output_sha256": "04f00887f81eeb473d19ad7470fbf53f38f8a525645f29717ec5c8aa86217784",
      "alignment_unit_index": 8,
      "alignment_score": null,
      "source_human_sentence_index": 10,
      "source_human_sha256": "04f00887f81eeb473d19ad7470fbf53f38f8a525645f29717ec5c8aa86217784",
      "ai_unit_sentence_indices": []
    },
    {
      "sentence_index": 12,
      "paragraph_index": 2,
      "origin": "ai",
      "text": "I always know their whereabouts and what I’ve done with them—unless they find their way into my pockets.",
      "output_sha256": "542d50be363a1eb8857d426131ef3bfbdc1c378252f105a47655b3853c867fbf",
      "alignment_unit_index": 9,
      "alignment_score": 0.431679,
      "human_sentence_indices": [
        11
      ],
      "human_sha256": [
        "e891627f2af2e17eb1099336bb7211daf11ccbc05fb21048c59a8b20bbe3dba4"
      ],
      "source_ai_sentence_index": 11,
      "source_ai_sha256": "542d50be363a1eb8857d426131ef3bfbdc1c378252f105a47655b3853c867fbf",
      "ai_unit_sentence_indices": [
        11
      ]
    },
    {
      "sentence_index": 13,
      "paragraph_index": 2,
      "origin": "human",
      "text": "If once anything slips into those unknown abysses, I wave it a sad Virgilian farewell.",
      "output_sha256": "0059963e594c0761b9ec2a34e436dc04f5193e115e2055f6f660faa36158d231",
      "alignment_unit_index": 10,
      "alignment_score": null,
      "source_human_sentence_index": 12,
      "source_human_sha256": "0059963e594c0761b9ec2a34e436dc04f5193e115e2055f6f660faa36158d231",
      "ai_unit_sentence_indices": []
    },
    {
      "sentence_index": 14,
      "paragraph_index": 2,
      "origin": "human",
      "text": "I suppose that the things that I have dropped into my pockets are still there; the same presumption applies to the things that I have dropped into the sea.",
      "output_sha256": "14bf7b89d16450ba6883d9bfd993f122b974f4f23d3170dfb34c2945170fb130",
      "alignment_unit_index": 11,
      "alignment_score": null,
      "source_human_sentence_index": 13,
      "source_human_sha256": "14bf7b89d16450ba6883d9bfd993f122b974f4f23d3170dfb34c2945170fb130",
      "ai_unit_sentence_indices": []
    },
    {
      "sentence_index": 15,
      "paragraph_index": 2,
      "origin": "human",
      "text": "But I regard the riches stored in both these bottomless chasms with the same reverent ignorance.",
      "output_sha256": "83de9b08f067acb1417f48625dd4add8945356164895334fdac116ea4c99361b",
      "alignment_unit_index": 12,
      "alignment_score": null,
      "source_human_sentence_index": 14,
      "source_human_sha256": "83de9b08f067acb1417f48625dd4add8945356164895334fdac116ea4c99361b",
      "ai_unit_sentence_indices": []
    },
    {
      "sentence_index": 16,
      "paragraph_index": 2,
      "origin": "ai",
      "text": "It is said that the sea will reveal its hidden treasures on the last day, and I imagine that would also apply to the unusual items lurking in my pockets.",
      "output_sha256": "b2ffbb06c5d1c0474c77a96ad8b95036a1371f801158fca08a9ff05a3d36b7ff",
      "alignment_unit_index": 13,
      "alignment_score": 0.372123,
      "human_sentence_indices": [
        15
      ],
      "human_sha256": [
        "30d8366d9f33a1d51e01d11dd539938c3e626dcc9660538530859b107fc3acbf"
      ],
      "source_ai_sentence_index": 15,
      "source_ai_sha256": "b2ffbb06c5d1c0474c77a96ad8b95036a1371f801158fca08a9ff05a3d36b7ff",
      "ai_unit_sentence_indices": [
        15
      ]
    },
    {
      "sentence_index": 17,
      "paragraph_index": 2,
      "origin": "human",
      "text": "But I have quite forgotten what any of them are; and there is really nothing (excepting the money) that I shall be at all surprised at finding among them.",
      "output_sha256": "69670ac1cd1cdadb229fd8869836529807607bf98f1b1883bb794a4229664e7d",
      "alignment_unit_index": 14,
      "alignment_score": null,
      "source_human_sentence_index": 16,
      "source_human_sha256": "69670ac1cd1cdadb229fd8869836529807607bf98f1b1883bb794a4229664e7d",
      "ai_unit_sentence_indices": []
    },
    {
      "sentence_index": 18,
      "paragraph_index": 3,
      "origin": "human",
      "text": ".....",
      "output_sha256": "f85d30e7d95a052f65167f1f1095186d1190c91502b4ab7aedab460a6eab8870",
      "alignment_unit_index": 14,
      "alignment_score": null,
      "source_human_sentence_index": 17,
      "source_human_sha256": "f85d30e7d95a052f65167f1f1095186d1190c91502b4ab7aedab460a6eab8870",
      "ai_unit_sentence_indices": []
    },
    {
      "sentence_index": 19,
      "paragraph_index": 4,
      "origin": "ai",
      "text": "This encapsulates my previously untainted state of innocence.",
      "output_sha256": "75e36f5f77dceb7fcfb1f2b429688cfea5c91331d6e98d857260d2dce709550d",
      "alignment_unit_index": 15,
      "alignment_score": 0.435,
      "human_sentence_indices": [
        18
      ],
      "human_sha256": [
        "eb2c8fe88426e9cb5fb5ec841d1c795b728110541307a361624781568ab94433"
      ],
      "source_ai_sentence_index": 17,
      "source_ai_sha256": "75e36f5f77dceb7fcfb1f2b429688cfea5c91331d6e98d857260d2dce709550d",
      "ai_unit_sentence_indices": [
        17
      ]
    },
    {
      "sentence_index": 20,
      "paragraph_index": 4,
      "origin": "human",
      "text": "I here only wish briefly to recall the special, extraordinary, and hitherto unprecedented circumstances which led me in cold blood, and being of sound mind, to turn out my pockets.",
      "output_sha256": "01fdd5ee5caf76f001874d2bb4a6d8543a60b5e360bf3a86c36c748912a0771c",
      "alignment_unit_index": 16,
      "alignment_score": null,
      "source_human_sentence_index": 19,
      "source_human_sha256": "01fdd5ee5caf76f001874d2bb4a6d8543a60b5e360bf3a86c36c748912a0771c",
      "ai_unit_sentence_indices": []
    },
    {
      "sentence_index": 21,
      "paragraph_index": 4,
      "origin": "ai",
      "text": "I found myself confined in a third-class train carriage for an extended journey.",
      "output_sha256": "08d729c2134b20744697db048345ecc62749d6e1c498c57be580c0fa980bfff9",
      "alignment_unit_index": 17,
      "alignment_score": 0.542308,
      "human_sentence_indices": [
        20
      ],
      "human_sha256": [
        "7a10f5816c7740c17fec6cddfd955fc9c9012f7b654befd43ad92d29d53739bb"
      ],
      "source_ai_sentence_index": 19,
      "source_ai_sha256": "08d729c2134b20744697db048345ecc62749d6e1c498c57be580c0fa980bfff9",
      "ai_unit_sentence_indices": [
        19
      ]
    },
    {
      "sentence_index": 22,
      "paragraph_index": 4,
      "origin": "human",
      "text": "The time was towards evening, but it might have been anything, for everything resembling earth or sky or light or shade was painted out as if with a great wet brush by an unshifting sheet of quite colourless rain.",
      "output_sha256": "fbf4536341c098d5138eaac526711629f9a84fb9d2ce8898a785ea918c1880d4",
      "alignment_unit_index": 18,
      "alignment_score": null,
      "source_human_sentence_index": 21,
      "source_human_sha256": "fbf4536341c098d5138eaac526711629f9a84fb9d2ce8898a785ea918c1880d4",
      "ai_unit_sentence_indices": []
    },
    {
      "sentence_index": 23,
      "paragraph_index": 4,
      "origin": "human",
      "text": "I had no books or newspapers.",
      "output_sha256": "e74e26963ad01292a5011286f5537c7b729751ed55fe700dd0b4b798d89394b4",
      "alignment_unit_index": 19,
      "alignment_score": null,
      "source_human_sentence_index": 22,
      "source_human_sha256": "e74e26963ad01292a5011286f5537c7b729751ed55fe700dd0b4b798d89394b4",
      "ai_unit_sentence_indices": []
    },
    {
      "sentence_index": 24,
      "paragraph_index": 4,
      "origin": "human",
      "text": "I had not even a pencil and a scrap of paper with which to write a religious epic.",
      "output_sha256": "29e5579b720d3dc8879d0c491bcb1cc47ad9093337ecd55be7829d927665ca2f",
      "alignment_unit_index": 19,
      "alignment_score": null,
      "source_human_sentence_index": 23,
      "source_human_sha256": "29e5579b720d3dc8879d0c491bcb1cc47ad9093337ecd55be7829d927665ca2f",
      "ai_unit_sentence_indices": []
    },
    {
      "sentence_index": 25,
      "paragraph_index": 4,
      "origin": "ai",
      "text": "There were no advertisements to peruse; otherwise, I could have delved into the depths of their printed words, as even the simplest phrase could ignite a cascade of mental exploration.",
      "output_sha256": "16612668b709dd24e2cc6e341c69904e59d17ae19d95b163535ea4536399e82e",
      "alignment_unit_index": 20,
      "alignment_score": 0.520167,
      "human_sentence_indices": [
        24
      ],
      "human_sha256": [
        "d1f6a9534c844afe38d45eb3f1220d3ae99bfa0f151f266b16f0305968e23f2c"
      ],
      "source_ai_sentence_index": 22,
      "source_ai_sha256": "16612668b709dd24e2cc6e341c69904e59d17ae19d95b163535ea4536399e82e",
      "ai_unit_sentence_indices": [
        22
      ]
    },
    {
      "sentence_index": 26,
      "paragraph_index": 4,
      "origin": "ai",
      "text": "Encountering a phrase like “Sunlight Soap” could lead me to ponder themes of sun worship, the mythology of Apollo, or the poetry of summer before reluctantly transitioning to the mundane topic of soap.",
      "output_sha256": "9da0d489c78c8c92d7258e45a3ed2acf2a960f6a8cf1fd1c9946c95780bf980a",
      "alignment_unit_index": 21,
      "alignment_score": 0.455114,
      "human_sentence_indices": [
        25
      ],
      "human_sha256": [
        "f5fd5a58214588ed13622fabd16737ded58a903aac03bddb7c3a165ef9b37680"
      ],
      "source_ai_sentence_index": 23,
      "source_ai_sha256": "9da0d489c78c8c92d7258e45a3ed2acf2a960f6a8cf1fd1c9946c95780bf980a",
      "ai_unit_sentence_indices": [
        23
      ]
    },
    {
      "sentence_index": 27,
      "paragraph_index": 4,
      "origin": "human",
      "text": "But there was no printed word or picture anywhere; there was nothing but blank wood inside the carriage and blank wet without.",
      "output_sha256": "1895e8bfe961662b5cbe400f12b9828e234b05e0080c08b4793a3b008c5b365c",
      "alignment_unit_index": 22,
      "alignment_score": null,
      "source_human_sentence_index": 26,
      "source_human_sha256": "1895e8bfe961662b5cbe400f12b9828e234b05e0080c08b4793a3b008c5b365c",
      "ai_unit_sentence_indices": []
    },
    {
      "sentence_index": 28,
      "paragraph_index": 4,
      "origin": "human",
      "text": "Now I deny most energetically that anything is, or can be, uninteresting.",
      "output_sha256": "1dc086854389049e73f7b567b6111aa3fdfce1a09d719a3625ff06f52705dd74",
      "alignment_unit_index": 23,
      "alignment_score": null,
      "source_human_sentence_index": 27,
      "source_human_sha256": "1dc086854389049e73f7b567b6111aa3fdfce1a09d719a3625ff06f52705dd74",
      "ai_unit_sentence_indices": []
    },
    {
      "sentence_index": 29,
      "paragraph_index": 4,
      "origin": "human",
      "text": "So I stared at the joints of the walls and seats, and began thinking hard on the fascinating subject of wood.",
      "output_sha256": "ea367269bcfd6e3d6b447d2b02c2c582e7849b865219d77a0364c57dc88cbdc2",
      "alignment_unit_index": 23,
      "alignment_score": null,
      "source_human_sentence_index": 28,
      "source_human_sha256": "ea367269bcfd6e3d6b447d2b02c2c582e7849b865219d77a0364c57dc88cbdc2",
      "ai_unit_sentence_indices": []
    },
    {
      "sentence_index": 30,
      "paragraph_index": 4,
      "origin": "human",
      "text": "Just as I had begun to realise why, perhaps, it was that Christ was a carpenter, rather than a bricklayer, or a baker, or anything else, I suddenly started upright, and remembered my pockets.",
      "output_sha256": "a1d42ece5fc09cf3253883b8049c705e9f6eef4021ec37bae440e91bfc5f06f4",
      "alignment_unit_index": 24,
      "alignment_score": null,
      "source_human_sentence_index": 29,
      "source_human_sha256": "a1d42ece5fc09cf3253883b8049c705e9f6eef4021ec37bae440e91bfc5f06f4",
      "ai_unit_sentence_indices": []
    },
    {
      "sentence_index": 31,
      "paragraph_index": 4,
      "origin": "human",
      "text": "I was carrying about with me an unknown treasury.",
      "output_sha256": "7ce4d71c4251a50c8f765bd054e26ff0b69eb8be2ffd02a996b9c337a8e55f87",
      "alignment_unit_index": 25,
      "alignment_score": null,
      "source_human_sentence_index": 30,
      "source_human_sha256": "7ce4d71c4251a50c8f765bd054e26ff0b69eb8be2ffd02a996b9c337a8e55f87",
      "ai_unit_sentence_indices": []
    },
    {
      "sentence_index": 32,
      "paragraph_index": 4,
      "origin": "human",
      "text": "I had a British Museum and a South Kensington collection of unknown curios hung all over me in different places.",
      "output_sha256": "b401bb1a71bc80f4ce608190379970ec6787d99280c619d982773935af4b4fcf",
      "alignment_unit_index": 25,
      "alignment_score": null,
      "source_human_sentence_index": 31,
      "source_human_sha256": "b401bb1a71bc80f4ce608190379970ec6787d99280c619d982773935af4b4fcf",
      "ai_unit_sentence_indices": []
    },
    {
      "sentence_index": 33,
      "paragraph_index": 4,
      "origin": "human",
      "text": "I began to take the things out.",
      "output_sha256": "dfcd621c15c799ccd8acad1c54ae30e4ea461e59c5c4bd1748cdba3efce93191",
      "alignment_unit_index": 26,
      "alignment_score": null,
      "source_human_sentence_index": 32,
      "source_human_sha256": "dfcd621c15c799ccd8acad1c54ae30e4ea461e59c5c4bd1748cdba3efce93191",
      "ai_unit_sentence_indices": []
    },
    {
      "sentence_index": 34,
      "paragraph_index": 5,
      "origin": "human",
      "text": ".....",
      "output_sha256": "f85d30e7d95a052f65167f1f1095186d1190c91502b4ab7aedab460a6eab8870",
      "alignment_unit_index": 27,
      "alignment_score": null,
      "source_human_sentence_index": 33,
      "source_human_sha256": "f85d30e7d95a052f65167f1f1095186d1190c91502b4ab7aedab460a6eab8870",
      "ai_unit_sentence_indices": []
    },
    {
      "sentence_index": 35,
      "paragraph_index": 6,
      "origin": "human",
      "text": "The first thing I came upon consisted of piles and heaps of Battersea tram tickets.",
      "output_sha256": "c2680c2d8ddd8c1a837825f06513bfa0f4d101cc4b29555888ce65149dd0c30b",
      "alignment_unit_index": 27,
      "alignment_score": null,
      "source_human_sentence_index": 34,
      "source_human_sha256": "c2680c2d8ddd8c1a837825f06513bfa0f4d101cc4b29555888ce65149dd0c30b",
      "ai_unit_sentence_indices": []
    },
    {
      "sentence_index": 36,
      "paragraph_index": 6,
      "origin": "human",
      "text": "There were enough to equip a paper chase.",
      "output_sha256": "0e47a65553def9754ded65835fe5f75eccfac12232b6a62c89034a50ea851935",
      "alignment_unit_index": 28,
      "alignment_score": null,
      "source_human_sentence_index": 35,
      "source_human_sha256": "0e47a65553def9754ded65835fe5f75eccfac12232b6a62c89034a50ea851935",
      "ai_unit_sentence_indices": []
    },
    {
      "sentence_index": 37,
      "paragraph_index": 6,
      "origin": "human",
      "text": "They shook down in showers like confetti.",
      "output_sha256": "8a1c90bd1982dbb370736993a082a403b88f32cef1f2d4d5d53ddea4d02dcecd",
      "alignment_unit_index": 28,
      "alignment_score": null,
      "source_human_sentence_index": 36,
      "source_human_sha256": "8a1c90bd1982dbb370736993a082a403b88f32cef1f2d4d5d53ddea4d02dcecd",
      "ai_unit_sentence_indices": []
    },
    {
      "sentence_index": 38,
      "paragraph_index": 6,
      "origin": "ai",
      "text": "These tickets evoked a wave of patriotic sentiment and even brought tears to my eyes.",
      "output_sha256": "d19d0824553ee6173fedd99849921e9f53ded0e35555ac0872488f0056455ace",
      "alignment_unit_index": 29,
      "alignment_score": 0.502984,
      "human_sentence_indices": [
        37
      ],
      "human_sha256": [
        "cbc54cad5a1090b0cc6c3b477172ca3d5256fbfc9f4ca5db80e00021fb00bfd7"
      ],
      "source_ai_sentence_index": 31,
      "source_ai_sha256": "d19d0824553ee6173fedd99849921e9f53ded0e35555ac0872488f0056455ace",
      "ai_unit_sentence_indices": [
        31,
        32
      ]
    },
    {
      "sentence_index": 39,
      "paragraph_index": 6,
      "origin": "ai",
      "text": "More importantly, they served as the printed material I craved, as I found brief yet compelling scientific essays about some kind of pill printed on their backs.",
      "output_sha256": "beb667d8ef1aa070458617d6678b81725ec3a1aeaa32d5dd78931ec312f1d425",
      "alignment_unit_index": 29,
      "alignment_score": 0.502984,
      "human_sentence_indices": [
        37
      ],
      "human_sha256": [
        "cbc54cad5a1090b0cc6c3b477172ca3d5256fbfc9f4ca5db80e00021fb00bfd7"
      ],
      "source_ai_sentence_index": 32,
      "source_ai_sha256": "beb667d8ef1aa070458617d6678b81725ec3a1aeaa32d5dd78931ec312f1d425",
      "ai_unit_sentence_indices": [
        31,
        32
      ]
    },
    {
      "sentence_index": 40,
      "paragraph_index": 6,
      "origin": "ai",
      "text": "In my state of destitution, those tickets could be considered a modest yet well-curated scientific library.",
      "output_sha256": "bfc1587f4ae2b455311fb32c39c97f10c0f0bc2ea2c6650f8aeb2fa5f268bd41",
      "alignment_unit_index": 30,
      "alignment_score": 0.499346,
      "human_sentence_indices": [
        38
      ],
      "human_sha256": [
        "e6ecbdaeb067879e7842f75c2a1432b5feed30bf46502186319231cbcecb16ab"
      ],
      "source_ai_sentence_index": 33,
      "source_ai_sha256": "bfc1587f4ae2b455311fb32c39c97f10c0f0bc2ea2c6650f8aeb2fa5f268bd41",
      "ai_unit_sentence_indices": [
        33
      ]
    },
    {
      "sentence_index": 41,
      "paragraph_index": 6,
      "origin": "ai",
      "text": "If my train journey were to persist for a few more months, I could foresee myself deeply engaging in the debates surrounding the pill, crafting responses and counter-arguments based on the data at hand.",
      "output_sha256": "a5e48dcabc5627179c4b7447baf54c263be440053740503e1b2716a54c348ff6",
      "alignment_unit_index": 31,
      "alignment_score": 0.393382,
      "human_sentence_indices": [
        39
      ],
      "human_sha256": [
        "3f501d14839c3437b4c7227e2163572cd37dc81ba52cd171d49197f987f76178"
      ],
      "source_ai_sentence_index": 34,
      "source_ai_sha256": "a5e48dcabc5627179c4b7447baf54c263be440053740503e1b2716a54c348ff6",
      "ai_unit_sentence_indices": [
        34
      ]
    },
    {
      "sentence_index": 42,
      "paragraph_index": 6,
      "origin": "ai",
      "text": "However, it was the symbolic essence of those tickets that truly resonated with me.",
      "output_sha256": "dcfbcf4a8838e281cebe5f732cf367ae6daa2e5077a9347a96a77856c1dae55f",
      "alignment_unit_index": 32,
      "alignment_score": 0.484943,
      "human_sentence_indices": [
        40
      ],
      "human_sha256": [
        "29072d9a395a29d70c75eeafceeb38414c853b1009a8541db8d1367907a6daa2"
      ],
      "source_ai_sentence_index": 35,
      "source_ai_sha256": "dcfbcf4a8838e281cebe5f732cf367ae6daa2e5077a9347a96a77856c1dae55f",
      "ai_unit_sentence_indices": [
        35
      ]
    },
    {
      "sentence_index": 43,
      "paragraph_index": 6,
      "origin": "human",
      "text": "For as certainly as the cross of St. George means English patriotism, those scraps of paper meant all that municipal patriotism which is now, perhaps, the greatest hope of England.",
      "output_sha256": "ca54e395bd7fe6c68652e0fc13e97e16edc7b81345ede1a5bdaebd80faf0cc34",
      "alignment_unit_index": 33,
      "alignment_score": null,
      "source_human_sentence_index": 41,
      "source_human_sha256": "ca54e395bd7fe6c68652e0fc13e97e16edc7b81345ede1a5bdaebd80faf0cc34",
      "ai_unit_sentence_indices": []
    },
    {
      "sentence_index": 44,
      "paragraph_index": 7,
      "origin": "human",
      "text": "The next thing that I took out was a pocket-knife.",
      "output_sha256": "09ae8a165b79dab7ffc91302ce0c95895313a9deaa28c0c15fead1e56fa426b8",
      "alignment_unit_index": 34,
      "alignment_score": null,
      "source_human_sentence_index": 42,
      "source_human_sha256": "09ae8a165b79dab7ffc91302ce0c95895313a9deaa28c0c15fead1e56fa426b8",
      "ai_unit_sentence_indices": []
    },
    {
      "sentence_index": 45,
      "paragraph_index": 7,
      "origin": "ai",
      "text": "A pocketknife, as one can imagine, could warrant an entire volume filled with moral reflections.",
      "output_sha256": "1f0323afada9dacb3fe4160875816835c5d7285b2bdc8f651071f26db4f89e1a",
      "alignment_unit_index": 35,
      "alignment_score": 0.259256,
      "human_sentence_indices": [
        43
      ],
      "human_sha256": [
        "c5ce43d87f77fe9906995be7d26c7ea41c967298cd52468781b42e160f2e0824"
      ],
      "source_ai_sentence_index": 38,
      "source_ai_sha256": "1f0323afada9dacb3fe4160875816835c5d7285b2bdc8f651071f26db4f89e1a",
      "ai_unit_sentence_indices": [
        38
      ]
    },
    {
      "sentence_index": 46,
      "paragraph_index": 7,
      "origin": "human",
      "text": "A knife typifies one of the most primary of those practical origins upon which as upon low, thick pillows all our human civilisation reposes.",
      "output_sha256": "b9764e59b05a3b285b1e12f1207efe9e14d9f784b4b10b99f93af25f782321f5",
      "alignment_unit_index": 36,
      "alignment_score": null,
      "source_human_sentence_index": 44,
      "source_human_sha256": "b9764e59b05a3b285b1e12f1207efe9e14d9f784b4b10b99f93af25f782321f5",
      "ai_unit_sentence_indices": []
    },
    {
      "sentence_index": 47,
      "paragraph_index": 7,
      "origin": "human",
      "text": "Metals, the mystery of the thing called iron and of the thing called steel, led me off half-dazed into a kind of dream.",
      "output_sha256": "a9438d65eb1b9612ebd4bcc449cefbfe42647a2f5ff2fb71d102f360ff464ef6",
      "alignment_unit_index": 37,
      "alignment_score": null,
      "source_human_sentence_index": 45,
      "source_human_sha256": "a9438d65eb1b9612ebd4bcc449cefbfe42647a2f5ff2fb71d102f360ff464ef6",
      "ai_unit_sentence_indices": []
    },
    {
      "sentence_index": 48,
      "paragraph_index": 7,
      "origin": "human",
      "text": "I saw into the intrails of dim, damp wood, where the first man among all the common stones found the strange stone.",
      "output_sha256": "d0343d3ea869c9f07d7372c9864c77ea36f8e70f0e5e5a2281a5c60fbf9ed395",
      "alignment_unit_index": 38,
      "alignment_score": null,
      "source_human_sentence_index": 46,
      "source_human_sha256": "d0343d3ea869c9f07d7372c9864c77ea36f8e70f0e5e5a2281a5c60fbf9ed395",
      "ai_unit_sentence_indices": []
    },
    {
      "sentence_index": 49,
      "paragraph_index": 7,
      "origin": "ai",
      "text": "I imagined a fierce struggle where stone axes shattered and stone knives splintered against something gleaming and novel in the hands of a determined person.",
      "output_sha256": "9012b9528b85a8b65f486f438a87b3b4a3bbce70da762f17bc272158413f4a9f",
      "alignment_unit_index": 39,
      "alignment_score": 0.497414,
      "human_sentence_indices": [
        47
      ],
      "human_sha256": [
        "746b586bbb70bca93c420b9d8795e920954c807fa299c57725249880f5fc02a6"
      ],
      "source_ai_sentence_index": 42,
      "source_ai_sha256": "9012b9528b85a8b65f486f438a87b3b4a3bbce70da762f17bc272158413f4a9f",
      "ai_unit_sentence_indices": [
        42
      ]
    },
    {
      "sentence_index": 50,
      "paragraph_index": 7,
      "origin": "ai",
      "text": "I could almost hear the clanging of hammers on anvils worldwide, and I visualized the swords of feudal conflicts and the scars of industrial warfare.",
      "output_sha256": "96224a140653573cdcaa70848901d1750bb7aaa8e9952c0a5f96da46b10a74a1",
      "alignment_unit_index": 40,
      "alignment_score": 0.514367,
      "human_sentence_indices": [
        48,
        49
      ],
      "human_sha256": [
        "25624b2fc9429d0adbaa9ecab3464cacc02a9371546257832720fea936fe3a06",
        "98efdbe3b5fb3be139646de4ead6cca33f46de01a4f5685206d1d58026b0cbd4"
      ],
      "source_ai_sentence_index": 43,
      "source_ai_sha256": "96224a140653573cdcaa70848901d1750bb7aaa8e9952c0a5f96da46b10a74a1",
      "ai_unit_sentence_indices": [
        43
      ]
    },
    {
      "sentence_index": 51,
      "paragraph_index": 7,
      "origin": "human",
      "text": "For the knife is only a short sword; and the pocket-knife is a secret sword.",
      "output_sha256": "bb0e7a6ba718c46aa20a8a18e0a64691d34049f6afd6222e870bd8f359759b39",
      "alignment_unit_index": 41,
      "alignment_score": null,
      "source_human_sentence_index": 50,
      "source_human_sha256": "bb0e7a6ba718c46aa20a8a18e0a64691d34049f6afd6222e870bd8f359759b39",
      "ai_unit_sentence_indices": []
    },
    {
      "sentence_index": 52,
      "paragraph_index": 7,
      "origin": "human",
      "text": "I opened it and looked at that brilliant and terrible tongue which we call a blade; and I thought that perhaps it was the symbol of the oldest of the needs of man.",
      "output_sha256": "55959a6e1807c938ccc0234d373c5411e66840dffb5d87dc6d134567cf6b014f",
      "alignment_unit_index": 42,
      "alignment_score": null,
      "source_human_sentence_index": 51,
      "source_human_sha256": "55959a6e1807c938ccc0234d373c5411e66840dffb5d87dc6d134567cf6b014f",
      "ai_unit_sentence_indices": []
    },
    {
      "sentence_index": 53,
      "paragraph_index": 7,
      "origin": "ai",
      "text": "Just as I formed this thought, I was surprised to find the next item emerging from my pocket was a box of matches.",
      "output_sha256": "850ff4a88c310fd74e2ac189625dbdba059ac596170ceafb989797dbf447ed90",
      "alignment_unit_index": 43,
      "alignment_score": 0.434595,
      "human_sentence_indices": [
        52
      ],
      "human_sha256": [
        "d7a42fdcb1d7f280078bb401f7c800f79bf43181f0d81811500a69d4f976e2a7"
      ],
      "source_ai_sentence_index": 46,
      "source_ai_sha256": "850ff4a88c310fd74e2ac189625dbdba059ac596170ceafb989797dbf447ed90",
      "ai_unit_sentence_indices": [
        46
      ]
    },
    {
      "sentence_index": 54,
      "paragraph_index": 7,
      "origin": "ai",
      "text": "In that moment, I recognized fire—an element more potent than steel, an ancient and fierce force that we cherish yet approach with caution.",
      "output_sha256": "57fcd5cdd09f5eea4c392d1390f368e8de898189be3459a6331a3fdbc33b5fe6",
      "alignment_unit_index": 44,
      "alignment_score": 0.358654,
      "human_sentence_indices": [
        53
      ],
      "human_sha256": [
        "1941238567476e11272977fd3f717660d0b6ba79ff07b7b1feff49347adaf509"
      ],
      "source_ai_sentence_index": 47,
      "source_ai_sha256": "57fcd5cdd09f5eea4c392d1390f368e8de898189be3459a6331a3fdbc33b5fe6",
      "ai_unit_sentence_indices": [
        47
      ]
    },
    {
      "sentence_index": 55,
      "paragraph_index": 8,
      "origin": "ai",
      "text": "Continuing my exploration, I stumbled upon a piece of chalk, which evoked a vision of all the art and frescoes that have adorned our world.",
      "output_sha256": "5e90e8778de5127a2672bdc3010f5df08e6d119c175d2375a1a316f41a2da31a",
      "alignment_unit_index": 45,
      "alignment_score": 0.503882,
      "human_sentence_indices": [
        54
      ],
      "human_sha256": [
        "fe649e33ed218b7c194b4978e152a535b391dcb628b55c286a24bf263b49496b"
      ],
      "source_ai_sentence_index": 48,
      "source_ai_sha256": "5e90e8778de5127a2672bdc3010f5df08e6d119c175d2375a1a316f41a2da31a",
      "ai_unit_sentence_indices": [
        48
      ]
    },
    {
      "sentence_index": 56,
      "paragraph_index": 8,
      "origin": "human",
      "text": "The next was a coin of a very modest value; and I saw in it not only the image and superscription of our own Caesar, but all government and order since the world began.",
      "output_sha256": "9d2bb865c8b9b1a77393c1088c3464c9c0b3201e1171bf3b5888bd3d1ae230aa",
      "alignment_unit_index": 46,
      "alignment_score": null,
      "source_human_sentence_index": 55,
      "source_human_sha256": "9d2bb865c8b9b1a77393c1088c3464c9c0b3201e1171bf3b5888bd3d1ae230aa",
      "ai_unit_sentence_indices": []
    },
    {
      "sentence_index": 57,
      "paragraph_index": 8,
      "origin": "human",
      "text": "But I have not space to say what were the items in the long and splendid procession of poetical symbols that came pouring out.",
      "output_sha256": "b73221b5ec10136134345d4819771f8bc7b1cf3981440ac79031c62cc68426cf",
      "alignment_unit_index": 47,
      "alignment_score": null,
      "source_human_sentence_index": 56,
      "source_human_sha256": "b73221b5ec10136134345d4819771f8bc7b1cf3981440ac79031c62cc68426cf",
      "ai_unit_sentence_indices": []
    },
    {
      "sentence_index": 58,
      "paragraph_index": 8,
      "origin": "human",
      "text": "I cannot tell you all the things that were in my pocket.",
      "output_sha256": "377435fcaa2cf25a7dbeed9fda1a98cab338973918860915319cb6d014dbc7d3",
      "alignment_unit_index": 47,
      "alignment_score": null,
      "source_human_sentence_index": 57,
      "source_human_sha256": "377435fcaa2cf25a7dbeed9fda1a98cab338973918860915319cb6d014dbc7d3",
      "ai_unit_sentence_indices": []
    },
    {
      "sentence_index": 59,
      "paragraph_index": 8,
      "origin": "human",
      "text": "I can tell you one thing, however, that I could not find in my pocket.",
      "output_sha256": "5c848fc824c721928e6b8e9ba6fd93183ff2c0db694b723b959b9d5b18455011",
      "alignment_unit_index": 48,
      "alignment_score": null,
      "source_human_sentence_index": 58,
      "source_human_sha256": "5c848fc824c721928e6b8e9ba6fd93183ff2c0db694b723b959b9d5b18455011",
      "ai_unit_sentence_indices": []
    },
    {
      "sentence_index": 60,
      "paragraph_index": 8,
      "origin": "human",
      "text": "I allude to my railway ticket.",
      "output_sha256": "690af13b9dd0724cc16256138662b81bbb50874f4dc12cd873fda809c77711c7",
      "alignment_unit_index": 48,
      "alignment_score": null,
      "source_human_sentence_index": 59,
      "source_human_sha256": "690af13b9dd0724cc16256138662b81bbb50874f4dc12cd873fda809c77711c7",
      "ai_unit_sentence_indices": []
    }
  ]
}
